    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1363">

                <pb facs="1105" n="1095" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg1095"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.7146/7–2049: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister-Counselor of Embassy in China</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Clark</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Canton</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-07-20T14:00:00+08:00">July 20, 1949—2 p.
                            m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received July 20—12:42 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Cantel 786. Closure Peiping USIE<anchor n="90" xml:id="d1363-f1"/> and
                    anticipated similar action Tientsin (probably already taken but unreported due
                    delays communications) and Nanking leaves us with definite impression Communist
                    action designed force our hand re recognition. May be first move in jockeying
                    for position since we have failed succumb their blandishments. Had expected
                    overtures long before now from at least some of powers. Fact US regarded as
                    leader common front nonrecognition may be direct cause closure order attempt
                    embarrass US Government and force our hand since Communists would consider it
                    extreme loss face if they put in position having make overture to foreign
                    imperialists beyond their oft-repeated statement willing establish diplomatic
                    relations any country withdrawing recognition Nationalists.</p>
                <p>For these reasons believe protests re closures unsuccessful and only course left
                    US is to sit back and wait developments, meantime redoubling <pb facs="1106"
                        n="1096" xml:id="pg1096"/> efforts get American facts before Chinese public
                    in Communist areas through stepped up VOA<anchor n="91" xml:id="d1363-f2"/>
                    activities.</p>
                <p>Sent Department Cantel 786; repeated Nanking 519.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Clark</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
